Package: credgate
Title: Governance Layer for LLM Requests with Indian PII Detection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person("Bharat", "Sikka", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "bharat8sikka@gmail.com"),
      person("Aishwarya", "Bais", role = "aut",
             email = "aishwarya.bais00@gmail.com"))
Description: Detects personal data before it leaves the machine, with
    Indian identifiers built in (Aadhaar with Verhoeff checksum, PAN,
    GSTIN, voter ID, passport, driving licence and more). Provides
    column-level PII scans of data frames, previews of what would be
    masked, reversible tokenisation, policy-based routing and a
    tamper-evident audit log for compliance review.
